('Shared-memory sizing manually mirrors three accumulator layouts','ReduceOperationConfig computes value/index slice counts per operation; CubeRoutine multiplies by slot count.',[S+'components/instructions/mixed.rs',S+'components/instructions/base.rs',S+'components/instructions/topk.rs',S+'routines/cube.rs'],'Typed Arg/TopK and Dynamic shared allocators remain separate implementations. Footprint helper tests assert selected cases but do not derive from generated layouts. Inferred clamp reduces occupancy or returns SharedMemoryOverflow; forced slot validation separately drifted, Q461.'),
